%% Discount application — the basket resolves every coupon code it
%% carries with a synchronous gRPC call to discount.grpc, which reads
%% the coupon from discountdb (Postgres). The stacking math is applied
%% by the basket (ApplyDiscountsHelper) and persisted with the basket.
%%
%% Source of truth: discount.proto (DiscountProtoService.GetDiscount /
%% ListDiscounts / RedeemDiscount), Basket.API/Discount/GrpcDiscountLookup.cs,
%% Basket.API/Basket/StoreBasket/StoreBasketHandler.cs.
%%
%% Traced by `trace_business_flow({flowName: 'discount-application'})` in
%% src/tools/flow-tracing.ts, which calls ListDiscounts → GetDiscount →
%% RedeemDiscount on discount.grpc:6002 and emits an info step (instead of
%% failing) when proto/discount.proto is missing.
%%
%% Last reconciled to code: 2026-10-24.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User (basket UI)
    participant Y as Yarp Gateway (:6004)
    participant B as basket.api (:6001)
    participant G as discount.grpc (:6002)
    participant D as discountdb PG (5437)

    U->>Y: PUT /basket-api/v1/cart { userId, restaurantId, items[], appliedDiscounts[] }
    Y->>B: forward StoreBasketCommand
    B->>B: load basket from basketdb (or Redis)

    loop one gRPC call per coupon code
        B->>G: gRPC GetDiscount { restaurant_id, code }
        G->>D: SELECT coupon WHERE restaurant_id = @rid AND code = @code
        D-->>G: coupon row (or none)
        G-->>B: GetDiscountResponse { coupon: CouponModel { code, description, amount, is_active, expiration_date, discount_type } }
    end

    Note over B: normalise to DiscountSnapshot — amount widened to decimal,<br/>expiration_date parsed to Instant (fail-closed on a malformed date)

    alt coupon inactive (IsActive=false) or expired
        B->>B: skip the coupon
    else coupon valid
        B->>B: ApplyDiscountsHelper.Apply(subtotal, applied[]) —<br/>percentage points or flat amount, clamped to the subtotal
    end

    B->>B: basket.AppliedCoupons / DiscountAmount / EffectiveSubtotal
    B->>Y: 200 with the updated basket
    Y-->>U: basket view shows the discount
